      "after": "One symmetric role of eight warps; overlap comes from the two-slot cp.async ring - chunk c+1 in flight during chunk c - and register-resident operands: 16 cached phase-1 A-fragment steps and the 64x512 FP32 accumulator. Costs 207,232 B smem"
