    },
    {
      "path": "split_kv.yaml.REALIZATION.Require[6].Reason",
      "before": "The merge is bound by dependent-load latency rather than bandwidth, so its parallelism has to come from threads; the 64-register cap is what limits the prefetched quad depth to four, and only the first 128 threads own the merged output",
